### 测试用户管理API接口

### 1. 获取用户列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/users?page=1&size=10
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. 获取用户详情
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

### 3. 更新用户状态
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/admin/users/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": 0,
  "reason": "测试禁用"
}

### 4. 删除用户
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/admin/users/3
Content-Type: application/json
